      "sourceTextSha256": "317fe048991c81ccd04086bbb71c5e0be956a62b8ce17c1424b434e764c7ef48",
      "text": "Panama City & Gamboa offer a remarkable combination of modern city life, colonial heritage, the engineering legacy of the Panama Canal and the extraordinary biodiversity of the surrounding rainforest. This six-day program combines the essential highlights of the capital with an authentic Emberá cultural experience and excursions into the tropical landscapes of Soberanía and Gamboa..",
